snaps2D.*mp4
**/Manifest.toml
*COPILOT*
coverage/
*.cov

# Internal documentation: working notes, design drafts, issue write-ups and the
# physics reference pages that are not finished enough to publish. Kept in the
# checkout so they stay next to the code they describe, but not part of the
# published repository. Builds to a local Documenter site (internal_docs/build,
# also ignored) — see internal_docs/make.jl. A page graduates by being moved to a
# tracked docs/, which is a move rather than a rewrite because the layout already
# matches Documenter's.
internal_docs/

# Transient shadow tree built by test/runtests_parallel.jl (ReTestItems parallel runner).
# Created and removed within a single run; only survives a hard kill. PID-suffixed so
# concurrent runs in one checkout cannot clobber each other.
/_partest_shadow_*/

# Simulation artifacts. SimulationConfig.Output_path defaults to a RELATIVE "./output",
# and TestItemRunner cd's into each test file's directory, so stray runs can drop these
# anywhere under test/. Fixtures point at mktempdir(); this is the backstop.
/output/
test/**/output/
test/output/
test/*.png
